Usage: vifstab verify [flags...] [operands...]

Verify fstab read-only with the caller's credentials.

Subcommands:
    help  Print this help message
    usage Print this usage message


Flags:
    --file string       (default: "/etc/fstab")   File to verify.

Positional Arguments:
    [operands...] No positional operands are accepted.
